          "id": "Proposition No. 1",
          "title": "Levy to Maintain Essential Services, Public Safety and Emergency Services, Operations and Capital Improvements",
          "summary": "Under Ordinance No. 1679, the City of Montesano would renew and raise its regular property tax levy to a total rate of up to $3.22 per $1,000 of assessed value for collection beginning in 2027. The 2026 levy amount would be used to recalculate later levy limits for up to six years, with an annual 5% limit factor. The added money would fund current service levels in the General Fund and public safety and emergency services.",
